{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-platform-sync-solutions","title":"跨平台同步方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/cross-platform-sync-solutions","wordCount":1255,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨平台同步方案\">跨平台同步方案</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨平台同步引擎将「客户端 SQLite ↔ 服务端 PostgreSQL」的双向同步抽象为统一 SDK。核心概念包括：三大引擎（PowerSync / ElectricSQL / Zero）的架构差异、Sync Rules 与 Shapes 的数据分区模型、自定义 vs LWW vs 服务端权威的冲突策略选择、移动端 SDK 成熟度评估，以及从 REST 到 Sync Engine 的渐进式迁移路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年跨平台同步引擎的崛起\">2026 年跨平台同步引擎的崛起</h2><p>当产品需要同时支持 iOS、Android、Web 甚至桌面端时，为每个平台分别实现同步逻辑会导致巨大的重复工作和行为不一致。2026 年，一批专门的跨平台同步引擎已达到生产就绪——它们将「本地 SQLite 数据库 ↔ 服务端 PostgreSQL」的双向同步抽象为统一的 SDK，开发者只需关注业务逻辑和冲突策略。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;客户端(多平台)&quot;&#10;        IOS[iOS App&lt;br/&gt;SQLite]&#10;        ANDROID[Android App&lt;br/&gt;SQLite]&#10;        WEB[Web App&lt;br/&gt;OPFS/IndexedDB]&#10;        RN[React Native&lt;br/&gt;SQLite]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;同步层&quot;&#10;        ENGINE[Sync Engine Service]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;服务端&quot;&#10;        PG[(PostgreSQL)]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    IOS &lt;--&gt; ENGINE&#10;    ANDROID &lt;--&gt; ENGINE&#10;    WEB &lt;--&gt; ENGINE&#10;    RN &lt;--&gt; ENGINE&#10;    ENGINE &lt;--&gt; PG\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph \"客户端(多平台)\"\n        IOS[iOS App&lt;br/&gt;SQLite]\n        ANDROID[Android App&lt;br/&gt;SQLite]\n        WEB[Web App&lt;br/&gt;OPFS/IndexedDB]\n        RN[React Native&lt;br/&gt;SQLite]\n    end\n    subgraph \"同步层\"\n        ENGINE[Sync Engine Service]\n    end\n    subgraph \"服务端\"\n        PG[(PostgreSQL)]\n    end\n\n    IOS &lt;--&gt; ENGINE\n    ANDROID &lt;--&gt; ENGINE\n    WEB &lt;--&gt; ENGINE\n    RN &lt;--&gt; ENGINE\n    ENGINE &lt;--&gt; PG</pre><h2 id=\"三大引擎对比-powersync-vs-electricsql-vs-zero\">三大引擎对比：PowerSync vs ElectricSQL vs Zero</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>PowerSync</th>\n<th>ElectricSQL</th>\n<th>Zero (Rocicorp)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>服务端数据库</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL, MongoDB, MySQL</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>任意（通过 server API）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端存储</td>\n<td>SQLite</td>\n<td>SQLite / PGlite (WASM)</td>\n<td>IndexedDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步方向</td>\n<td>双向（Push via API，Pull via streaming）</td>\n<td>双向（Postgres logical replication）</td>\n<td>双向（Mutators + Server Authority）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突解决</td>\n<td>自定义（开发者 API 端点）</td>\n<td>LWW（last-write-wins）</td>\n<td>服务端权威（server rebases）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分同步</td>\n<td>Sync Rules (YAML 声明式)</td>\n<td>Shapes（声明式订阅）</td>\n<td>ZQL 查询定义同步范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动端 SDK</td>\n<td>React Native, Flutter, Kotlin, Swift</td>\n<td>React Native</td>\n<td>React (Web 为主)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟度</td>\n<td>生产就绪（百万用户验证）</td>\n<td>快速演进中</td>\n<td>1.x stable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价</td>\n<td>Free tier + 商业</td>\n<td>OSS (Apache 2.0)</td>\n<td>OSS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"powersync-移动端最成熟的选择\">PowerSync：移动端最成熟的选择</h2><p>PowerSync 专为移动端设计，是 2026 年移动 CTO 的首选同步引擎。其架构核心：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>PostgreSQL WAL Streaming</strong>：监听 Postgres 的 Write-Ahead Log，捕获所有数据变更</li>\n<li><strong>Sync Rules</strong>：YAML 格式声明「哪些数据同步给哪些用户」——类似权限过滤</li>\n<li><strong>Client SDK</strong>：客户端读写本地 SQLite，SDK 自动处理上行推送和下行拉取</li>\n<li><strong>自定义写入路径</strong>：写操作通过开发者定义的 API 端点上传，开发者完全控制校验和冲突处理</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# sync-rules.yaml — 定义数据同步规则&#10;bucket_definitions:&#10;  user_tasks:&#10;    parameters:&#10;      - SELECT token_parameters.user_id AS user_id&#10;    data:&#10;      - SELECT id, title, content, priority, updated_at&#10;        FROM tasks&#10;        WHERE user_id = bucket.user_id&#10;&#10;  shared_projects:&#10;    parameters:&#10;      - SELECT pm.project_id&#10;        FROM project_members pm&#10;        WHERE pm.user_id = token_parameters.user_id&#10;    data:&#10;      - SELECT p.id, p.name, p.description&#10;        FROM projects p&#10;        WHERE p.id = bucket.project_id\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># sync-rules.yaml — 定义数据同步规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">bucket_definitions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  user_tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    parameters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT token_parameters.user_id AS user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT id, title, content, priority, updated_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        FROM tasks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHERE user_id = bucket.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  shared_projects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    parameters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT pm.project_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        FROM project_members pm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHERE pm.user_id = token_parameters.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT p.id, p.name, p.description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        FROM projects p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHERE p.id = bucket.project_id</span></span></code></pre></div><p>React Native 客户端集成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { PowerSyncDatabase } from &#39;@powersync/react-native&#39;;&#10;import { usePowerSync, useQuery } from &#39;@powersync/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;// Schema 定义（镜像服务端表结构）&#10;const schema = new Schema([&#10;  new Table({&#10;    name: &#39;tasks&#39;,&#10;    columns: [&#10;      new Column({ name: &#39;title&#39;, type: ColumnType.TEXT }),&#10;      new Column({ name: &#39;content&#39;, type: ColumnType.TEXT }),&#10;      new Column({ name: &#39;priority&#39;, type: ColumnType.INTEGER }),&#10;      new Column({ name: &#39;updated_at&#39;, type: ColumnType.TEXT }),&#10;    ],&#10;  }),&#10;]);&#10;&#10;// 初始化 PowerSync&#10;const db = new PowerSyncDatabase({&#10;  schema,&#10;  database: { dbFilename: &#39;app.db&#39; },&#10;});&#10;&#10;await db.connect(new PowerSyncBackendConnector(/* ... */));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { PowerSyncDatabase } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@powersync/react-native'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { usePowerSync, useQuery } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@powersync/react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Schema 定义（镜像服务端表结构）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> schema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tasks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    columns: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: ColumnType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: ColumnType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'priority'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: ColumnType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'updated_at'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: ColumnType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 初始化 PowerSync</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PowerSyncDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  database: { dbFilename: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'app.db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PowerSyncBackendConnector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* ... */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"electricsql-postgres-原生同步\">ElectricSQL：Postgres 原生同步</h2><p>ElectricSQL 的核心理念是「让 Postgres 成为同步引擎」——直接利用 Postgres 的 logical replication 将数据子集（Shape）流式同步到客户端。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { useShape } from &#39;@electric-sql/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function TaskList({ projectId }: { projectId: string }) {&#10;  const { data: tasks } = useShape({&#10;    url: `${ELECTRIC_URL}/v1/shape`,&#10;    params: {&#10;      table: &#39;tasks&#39;,&#10;      where: `project_id = &#39;${projectId}&#39;`,&#10;      columns: [&#39;id&#39;, &#39;title&#39;, &#39;priority&#39;, &#39;completed&#39;]&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return tasks.map(task =&gt; &lt;TaskItem key={task.id} task={task} /&gt;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useShape } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@electric-sql/react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">projectId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">projectId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useShape</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ELECTRIC_URL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/v1/shape`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    params: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      table: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tasks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      where: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`project_id = '${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">projectId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      columns: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'priority'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tasks.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TaskItem</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} />);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ElectricSQL 的 Shape 订阅模型特别适合「数据分区明确」的场景（如多租户 SaaS），但其 LWW 冲突策略不可自定义，对需要复杂合并的场景有局限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"zero-客户端响应式缓存\">Zero：客户端响应式缓存</h2><p>Zero（由 Replicache 的创建者 Aaron Boodman 开发）采用不同于 PowerSync/Electric 的理念——它不是「把服务端数据同步到客户端 SQLite」，而是「客户端维护一个响应式缓存，通过 mutator 函数定义写入逻辑，服务端权威性地 rebase 客户端变更」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Zero } from &#39;@rocicorp/zero&#39;;&#10;&#10;const z = new Zero({&#10;  server: &#39;https://api.example.com/zero&#39;,&#10;  schema: taskSchema,&#10;  auth: getAuthToken,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 读取：ZQL 响应式查询&#10;const tasks = z.query.task.where(&#39;projectId&#39;, &#39;=&#39;, projectId).orderBy(&#39;priority&#39;, &#39;desc&#39;).materialize();&#10;&#10;// 写入：通过 mutator&#10;await z.mutate.task.create({&#10;  id: crypto.randomUUID(),&#10;  title: &#39;New task&#39;,&#10;  projectId,&#10;  priority: 1,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Zero } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@rocicorp/zero'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Zero</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  server: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://api.example.com/zero'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema: taskSchema,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  auth: getAuthToken,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 读取：ZQL 响应式查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tasks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z.query.task.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'projectId'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'='</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, projectId).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">orderBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'priority'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'desc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">materialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 写入：通过 mutator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z.mutate.task.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id: crypto.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">randomUUID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'New task'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  projectId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  priority: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Zero 的优势是开发体验接近「本地数据库 + 普通 CRUD」，但目前 mobile SDK 支持不如 PowerSync 成熟（主要面向 React Web）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨平台选型决策矩阵\">跨平台选型决策矩阵</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[选择同步引擎] --&gt; Q1{后端是 PostgreSQL?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|否| PS[PowerSync&lt;br/&gt;支持 MongoDB/MySQL]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{需要自定义冲突解决?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|是| PS2[PowerSync&lt;br/&gt;自定义 API 端点]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{主要平台?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|移动端为主| PS3[PowerSync&lt;br/&gt;最成熟移动 SDK]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|Web 为主| ZERO[Zero&lt;br/&gt;最佳 React DX]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|两者兼顾| Q4{开源优先?}&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|是| ELECTRIC[ElectricSQL&lt;br/&gt;Apache 2.0]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|否| PS4[PowerSync&lt;br/&gt;商业支持]\">flowchart TD\n    START[选择同步引擎] --&gt; Q1{后端是 PostgreSQL?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|否| PS[PowerSync&lt;br/&gt;支持 MongoDB/MySQL]\n    Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{需要自定义冲突解决?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|是| PS2[PowerSync&lt;br/&gt;自定义 API 端点]\n    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{主要平台?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|移动端为主| PS3[PowerSync&lt;br/&gt;最成熟移动 SDK]\n    Q3 --&gt;|Web 为主| ZERO[Zero&lt;br/&gt;最佳 React DX]\n    Q3 --&gt;|两者兼顾| Q4{开源优先?}\n    Q4 --&gt;|是| ELECTRIC[ElectricSQL&lt;br/&gt;Apache 2.0]\n    Q4 --&gt;|否| PS4[PowerSync&lt;br/&gt;商业支持]</pre><h2 id=\"flutter-集成-powersync-drift\">Flutter 集成：PowerSync + Drift</h2><p>Flutter 生态中，PowerSync 提供一等 Dart SDK，可搭配 Drift（前身 moor）作为类型安全的 SQLite 层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;package:powersync/powersync.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;class TaskRepository {&#10;  final PowerSyncDatabase db;&#10;&#10;  TaskRepository(this.db);&#10;&#10;  Stream&lt;List&lt;Task&gt;&gt; watchAll() {&#10;    return db.watch(&#10;      &#39;SELECT * FROM tasks ORDER BY priority DESC&#39;,&#10;    ).map((rows) =&gt; rows.map(Task.fromRow).toList());&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;void&gt; create(Task task) async {&#10;    await db.execute(&#10;      &#39;INSERT INTO tasks (id, title, priority) VALUES (?, ?, ?)&#39;,&#10;      [task.id, task.title, task.priority],&#10;    );&#10;    // PowerSync SDK 自动将变更入队并在联网时推送&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:powersync/powersync.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class TaskRepository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final PowerSyncDatabase db;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  TaskRepository(this.db);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Stream&#x3C;List&#x3C;Task>> watchAll() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return db.watch(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      'SELECT * FROM tasks ORDER BY priority DESC',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ).map((rows) => rows.map(Task.fromRow).toList());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;void> create(Task task) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await db.execute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      'INSERT INTO tasks (id, title, priority) VALUES (?, ?, ?)',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      [task.id, task.title, task.priority],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // PowerSync SDK 自动将变更入队并在联网时推送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与原生同步方案的协作\">与原生同步方案的协作</h2><p>跨平台引擎并非排斥平台原生方案。混合架构在实践中很常见：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>iOS 方案</th>\n<th>Android 方案</th>\n<th>跨平台层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户偏好</td>\n<td>iCloud KV Store</td>\n<td>DataStore</td>\n<td>平台原生（体积小、频率低）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心业务数据</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>PowerSync/Electric（一致行为）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协作文档</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>Yjs + 自建同步通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大文件/媒体</td>\n<td>CloudKit Assets</td>\n<td>GCS/S3</td>\n<td>平台原生 CDN 上传</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键原则：选择跨平台引擎不意味着放弃平台能力。将「结构化业务数据的双向同步」委托给跨平台引擎，将「平台级系统集成」（推送通知、后台任务调度、文件管理）留给原生实现。两者通过 Repository 层桥接——与 <a href=\"ios-core-data-cloudkit\">iOS Core Data 与 CloudKit 同步</a> 和 <a href=\"android-room-workmanager\">Android Room 与 WorkManager</a> 中的架构分层保持一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迁移路径-从-rest-到-sync-engine\">迁移路径：从 REST 到 Sync Engine</h2><p>已有的 REST API 应用如何渐进式迁移到同步引擎架构：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>引入本地 SQLite 缓存</strong>：API 响应写入本地 DB，UI 从 DB 读取</li>\n<li><strong>添加离线写入队列</strong>：本地写入 → 入队列 → 后台推送到 REST API</li>\n<li><strong>切换到 Sync Engine</strong>：用 PowerSync/Electric 替换自建的推拉逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>移除 REST 轮询</strong>：改为 sync engine 的实时推送</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每一步都是独立可发布的增量改进，不需要一次性重写。这也是 <a href=\"../operations/bandwidth-battery-optimization\">带宽与电量优化</a> 讨论的减少 REST 轮询的核心手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>2026 年跨平台同步引擎已成为移动端 local-first 架构的主流选择。PowerSync 在移动端成熟度最高（多平台 SDK + 自定义冲突），ElectricSQL 在开源和 Postgres 原生性上占优，Zero 为 React Web 提供最佳开发体验。选型需综合考虑后端数据库、冲突策略需求、目标平台和团队偏好。渐进式迁移路径让已有 REST 应用也能平滑过渡到 sync engine 架构。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨平台同步方案","id":"跨平台同步方案"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年跨平台同步引擎的崛起","id":"2026-年跨平台同步引擎的崛起"},{"level":2,"text":"三大引擎对比：PowerSync vs ElectricSQL vs Zero","id":"三大引擎对比-powersync-vs-electricsql-vs-zero"},{"level":2,"text":"PowerSync：移动端最成熟的选择","id":"powersync-移动端最成熟的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"ElectricSQL：Postgres 原生同步","id":"electricsql-postgres-原生同步"},{"level":2,"text":"Zero：客户端响应式缓存","id":"zero-客户端响应式缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台选型决策矩阵","id":"跨平台选型决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"Flutter 集成：PowerSync + Drift","id":"flutter-集成-powersync-drift"},{"level":2,"text":"与原生同步方案的协作","id":"与原生同步方案的协作"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移路径：从 REST 到 Sync Engine","id":"迁移路径-从-rest-到-sync-engine"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Android Room 与 WorkManager","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/android-room-workmanager"},"next":{"title":"同步监控与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/sync-monitoring-debugging"}}